  "estimatedMinutes": 2,
  "statement": "The product \\[ \\begin{aligned} &\\left(1-\\frac1{2^2}\\right) \\left(1-\\frac1{3^2}\\right)\\\\ &\\quad{}\\cdots \\left(1-\\frac1{9^2}\\right) \\left(1-\\frac1{10^2}\\right) \\end{aligned} \\] equals",
